window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>When a half-Vampire/half-Witch Queen falls for a hot Warlock, a sexy-as-sin Vampire and a mysterious brooding Wolf, what could possibly go wrong?</i></b></p> <p>When I'm handed the crown and labeled Vampire Queen, I know I have a lot of catching up to do. It doesn't help that I'm also a Witch with wonky magick and have no place in my father's Coven. </p> <p>Already involved with a forbidden love, I find myself drawn to two hot refugees who've landed on my doorstep for asylum. </p> <p>The Hunters who threaten all of supernatural kind are relentless in their fight against us, but we're no slouches in that department either and have a plan to end them for good. But one of them has a seductive pull on me, and the question is does he want to jump me or kill me?</p> <p>Listen to the first book in this hot, new Reverse Harem Paranormal Series to find out!</p> <p>May contain triggering situations.</p>"; 
